k/framework work so the two lanes stay isolated.\n\nPERSONAL OPERATIONS HANDOFF — 2026-09-08 MORNING\n\nThis chat is PERSONAL OPERATIONS ONLY.\n\nDo not reopen GCE / EC⁸ architecture, AI-stack governance, scraper architecture, seat routing, model/provider design, or technical framework work unless Don explicitly brings it into this chat.\n\nThe AI / operational-strategic framework is being moved to a separate dedicated chat.\n\nCURRENT MOMENT\n\nDate: Tuesday, September 8, 2026\n\nDon is closing out the current Airbnb / lodging setup in Las Vegas.\n\nImmediate sequence:\n\npersonal closeout → 10:00 AM interview → 11:00 AM checkout → move to Excalibur → establish better TV/Wi-Fi/work setup\n\nExcalibur is expected to provide a better physical work setup, including TV/display arrangement and hopefully better internet stability.\n\nDo not overload the period before the interview with unnecessary planning.\n\nPERSONAL OPERATING PRIORITIES\n\nKeep the personal lane organized into these buckets:\n\n1. Immediate Vegas logistics\n\n* Interview at 10:00 AM.\n* Checkout around 11:00 AM.\n* Move to Excalibur.\n* Re-establish laptop / Wi-Fi / display / charging setup after arrival.\n* Handle hotel, food, transportation, cash, and reservation issues only as actually needed.\n\n2. Money / liquidity\nMaintain conservative cash-flow discipline.\n\nRules:\n\n* Do not count future income until received.\n* Do not treat casino promotional value as cash.\n* Hotel holds are earmarked liquidity, not spendable money.\n* Protect food, transportation, communications, lodging, and work-enablement first.\n\n3. Career / interviews\nCareer has its own working lane/artifacts, but personal logistics should support it.\n\nCurrent highest-value long-term opportunity remains Myers-Holum, with RF-SMART behind it and other opportunities evaluated on fit rather than activity.\n\nToday’s 10:00 interview is primarily a professional-relationship obligation unless new information materially changes its attractiveness.\n\nDo not turn this personal chat into full job-search operations unless needed for immediate scheduling/logistics.\n\n4. Playa del Karma / family relocation\nThis remains a major personal program.\n\nCurrent direction:\n\n* Family move targeted within the next several months / by roughly December.\n* Playa selected as the family base.\n* Apartment target has evolved toward a good 2–3BR family/work setup rather than a temporary tourist apartment.\n* Desired area is approximately around 15th Avenue / central Playa rather than directly on 5th.\n* Real kitchen/stove, reliable internet, office space, room for son/family growth, and livability matter more than flashy amenities.\n* Landing concept remains short-term neighborhood testing first, then lease.\n* Daphne is a potential relocation / apartment-search operating partner.\n* Jason is useful current-ground-truth context.\n* This is a 5–10 year family strategy: rent first, likely around two years, then evaluate purchasing a condo/home base.\n\nKeep Playa planning practical:\nhousing → family landing → work infrastructure → legal/immigration → budget → neighborhood testing → long-term ownership\n\n5. Family\nFamily/homecoming is the center of the broader personal plan.\n\nDon’s wife and son are currently in Mexico while Don is handling work/career/logistics in the U.S.\n\nRecent movie/personal discussion reinforced the simple emotional anchor:\n\nmake it home\n\nDo not over-psychologize that. It is context, not a task framework.\n\n6. Personal context / craft\nPersonal chronology and personality artifacts already exist in Google Drive.\n\nUseful recurring patterns captured:\n\n* craft over spotlight\n* meaning over structure\n* patience over impulse\n* earned payoff over spectacle\n* authenticity over imitation\n* create the read, then break the read\n* control the game state rather than blindly following the meta\n* infrastructure should reveal skill rather than mask it\n\nGaming, music, movies, storytelling, family, and personal history belong in this lane when relevant.\n\nThey are not GCE doctrine unless Don explicitly promotes something into that framework.\n\n7. Personal AI / mobile execution assistant\nEarly concept only.\n\nDon wants a phone-first personal execution assistant eventually:\n\nvoice command → intent → deterministic execution → short confirmation\n\nPrimary purposes:\n\n* reminders\n* calendar\n* notes\n* tasks\n* small/macro events\n* simple messaging\n* personal execution while walking/traveling/working\n\nThink “voice-controlled personal execution layer,” not chatbot companion.\n\niPhone and Android approaches should both be evaluated later.\n\nThis is not a current build priority this morning.\n\nWORKING STYLE FOR THIS CHAT\n\nDon tends to think rapidly and open multiple personal loops while moving around.\n\nHelp by:\n\n* sorting thoughts into existing buckets\n* closing loops\n* distinguishing NOW / LATER / PARKED\n* avoiding unnecessary new projects\n* preserving anchors\n* asking only questions that materially affect execution\n\nDo not make everything into a framework.\n\nDo not force every insight into an artifact.\n\nKeep responses direct, conversational, and operational.\n\nTODAY — BEFORE OPENING ANY NEW ANALYSIS\n\nFirst establish only:\n\n1. Did the 10:00 interview happen and did anything materially change?\n2. Did checkout/move to Excalibur complete?\n3. What is the actual Wi-Fi / workstation condition after arrival?\n4. Any material cash, reservation, family, or job messages since this handoff?\n5. What personal item actually needs attention next?\n\nEverything else can wait.\n\nCURRENT PERSONAL OPEN ITEMS\n\n* Complete interview.\n* Checkout and move to Excalibur.\n* Establish reliable work environment.\n* Continue Playa del Karma planning later.\n* Review/follow up with Daphne when useful.\n* Maintain conservative Vegas cash-flow / hotel plan.\n* Personal mobile AI assistant remains a future POC/design item.\n* Continue separating personal, career, and GCE/framework chats rather than allowing one giant conversation to become the source of every operating lane.\n\nSESSION START RULE\n\nDo not reconstruct Don’s entire biography or planning history.\n\nStart from the current operating state above and update only what changed.\n\nSTATUS: PROCEED\nCONFIDENCE: 97%\nOUTCOME: personal lane isolated and ready for continuation\nOPEN ITEMS: interview · Excalibur move · work setup · Playa/family follow-ups · personal execution assistant later\nNEXT ROUTE: immediate personal morning execution\nDON INPUT NEEDED: only real-world changes since this handoff\n\nThat should give the new personal chat everything it needs without dragging the AI organization into it. The second handoff later can be pure GCE / AI-stack operational-strategic state.", "start_idx": 0, "title": "Check interview backup", "type": "grouped_webpages", "url": "https://chatgpt.com/c/6aa02a89-f23c-83e8-8a70-8dccdb3c79f3"}, "citation_uuid": "204c1a12-13f2-42cc-b72f-999e1978488d", "deleted": false, "feedback": null, "retrieval_origin": "pca"}, {"citation": {"alt": "", "attribution": "Past chat", "category": "memory", "end_idx": 0, "matched_text": "", "prompt_text": null, "pub_date": 1788124043.093, "refs": [], "retrieval_origin": "pca", "snippet": "Hey, I need a simple prompt. To audit all subfolders. And catalog them. Catalog them. By just folder name, type, and last used. An AI agent. ", "start_idx": 0, "title": "Vdara close out - froze ", "type": "grouped_webpages", "url": "https://chatgpt.com/c/6a949b6e-bcf0-83e8-9105-eca4a47db58e"}, "citation_uuid": "730d6a7b-5d6a-4332-a005-f9aea5b577b0", "deleted": false, "feedback": null, "retrieval_origin": "pca"}, {"citation": {"alt": "", "attribution": "Past chat", "category": "memory", "end_idx": 0, "matched_text": "", "prompt_text": null, "pub_date": 1789066878.640336, "refs": [], "retrieval_origin": "pca", "snippet": "Go ahead and pull up everything from the Vegas budget to entertainment and fo